# Generated NetWalk game assets.
#
# overlay.nw is rebuilt from the original NETWALK.EXE by tools/nwextract.py or
# by docker/build-releases.sh --extract-assets. Runtime sprite dumps, rendered
# asset trees, and repacked overlays are generated artifacts too. Keeping them
# ignored avoids committing multi-megabyte game data or debug dumps.
#
# Runtime saves are created by the game and are not source assets.
*
!.gitignore
!icon.png
!Gamos_logo.png
!icons/
!icons/**
